    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 5 of the Intellectual Property Act, No. 36 of2003 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect of thesection as amended is to insert certain new definitions as consequential to the new section12A inserted in the principal enactment.",
