    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      277.73,
      401.91,
      303.59
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      321.53,
      401.88,
      347.39
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Intellectual Property(Amendment) Act, No. of 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      365.33,
      401.91,
      405.83
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 5 of the Intellectual Property Act, No. 36 of2003 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) ishereby amended as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      423.65,
      401.91,
      464.27
    ],
    "text": "(1)by the insertion immediately before the definitionof the expression \u201caudiovisual work\u201d, of thefollowing definition:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      200.85,
      482.09,
      401.89,
      668.63
    ],
    "text": "\u2018\u201caccessible format\u201d means a copy of a work in analternative form or manner which gives abeneficiary person access to such work,including to permit such person to have accessas feasibly and comfortably as a personwithout any disability which a beneficiaryperson has. The accessible format copy shallbe used exclusively by beneficiary personsand shall respect the intergrity of the originalwork, taking into consideration of the changesneeded to make the work accessible in thealternative format and of the accessibilityneeds of the beneficiary person;\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      322.51,
      443.86,
      331.58
    ],
    "text": "Short title.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      365.23,
      450.58,
      412.7
    ],
    "text": "Amendmentof section 5of Act,No. 36 of2003.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
