  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      171.91,
      203.45,
      397.19,
      240.11
    ],
    "text": "(2)by the insertion immediately after the definition ofthe expression \u201cauthor\u201d of the followingdefinition:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      193.15,
      254.21,
      385.19,
      265.55
    ],
    "text": "\u201c \u201cbeneficiary person\u201d means any person who\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      217.87,
      279.65,
      267.91,
      290.99
    ],
    "text": "(a) is blind;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      217.87,
      304.97,
      397.18,
      417.95
    ],
    "text": "(b) has a visual impairment or a perceptualor reading disability which cannot beimproved to give visual functionsubstantially equivalent to a person whohas no such impairment or disability andis unable to read printed works tosubstantially the same degree as a personwithout any such impairment ordisability; or",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      218.71,
      431.93,
      397.18,
      481.43
    ],
    "text": "(c) is otherwise unable, through physicaldisability to hold or manipulate a bookor to focus or move eyes to the extent thatis acceptable for reading,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      217.15,
      495.53,
      359.6,
      506.87
    ],
    "text": "regardless of any other disability;\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      520.85,
      397.18,
      557.63
    ],
    "text": "3. The following new section is hereby insertedimmediately after section 12 of the principal enactment andshall have effect as section 12A of that enactment:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      569.81,
      397.19,
      670.07
    ],
    "text": "12A. (1)(a) Notwithstanding anythingcontained in this Part, any authorized entitymay adapt, reproduce and issue of copies ofany work in an accessible format for the benefitof a beneficiary person in order to facilitate suchbeneficiary person to access such workincluding the sharing with any otherbeneficiary person of such work where the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      403.15,
      521.71,
      443.59,
      569.18
    ],
    "text": "Insertion ofnew section12A in theprincipalenactment.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      572.95,
      203.59,
      639.62
    ],
    "text": "\u201cFair use of awork by anyauthorizedentity tofacilitate abeneficiaryperson.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      140.95,
      659.69,
      151.39,
      671.03
    ],
    "text": "30",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      211.29,
      166.97,
      401.69,
      178.31
    ],
    "text": "Intellectual Property (Amendment)3",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      203.09,
      401.89,
      300.59
    ],
    "text": "reproduction is made exclusively for the ownuse of the beneficiary person, his educationalpurpose or research and where the originalformat of such work prevents the enjoymentthereof by such person. Such adaptation,reproduction and issue of copies of any workby the authorized entity shall not be aninfringement of copyright.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      313.85,
      401.9,
      411.23
    ],
    "text": "(b) The provisions of paragraph (a) shallapply for any work only where such work is notcommercially available in such accessibleformat under reasonable terms. In such event,the Minister shall deposit a notification withthe Director-General of the World IntellectualProperty Organization declaring the limitationsor exceptions, as the case may be, to such work.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      227.85,
      436.85,
      352.32,
      448.19
    ],
    "text": "(2) An authorized entity shall\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      243.57,
      461.45,
      401.88,
      509.63
    ],
    "text": "(a) be such persons or organizations asshall be prescribed by the Ministerin consultation with the Director-General of Intellectual Property;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      243.57,
      522.89,
      401.87,
      595.79
    ],
    "text": "(b) make available to any beneficiaryperson copies of any work inaccessible format on non-profit basisrecovering only the cost of theproduction of such work in anaccessible format;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      244.29,
      609.05,
      401.88,
      669.83
    ],
    "text": "(c) ensure that copies of any work inaccessible format are used only by abeneficiary person and takereasonable steps to prevent its entryinto ordinary channels of business;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
