    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      238.87,
      203.33,
      397.17,
      277.67
    ],
    "text": "(d) limit the supply of copies of anywork in accessible format only toadapt, reproduce and issue of copiesof such work to the beneficiarypersons or any other persons actingon behalf of the beneficiary person;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      239.71,
      291.53,
      397.16,
      340.67
    ],
    "text": "(e) discourage the reproduction,distribution and making availableof unauthorized copies of any workin acccessible format; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
